WEBVTT

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:05.270
Seisa, I did it!

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:08.360
The school has finally recognized my new club!

00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:10.530
We got a new room, too!

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:14.320
Which is why today, Eruna Ichinomiya
will leave the mansion!

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:16.370
Please, take this!

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:19.290
My sleeping bag soaked with many memories...

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:24.000
When you're lonely at night,
you can always remember me with this!

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:31.630
Just take that sleeping bag soaked
with sweat and body odor and leave.

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:32.840
Huh?

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:41.060
I will definitely make my club fun!

00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:42.730
Thanks for everything!

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:05.700
Ryui...

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:14.920
This is hard, ryui...

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:19.720
Oh, this is how you turned into a human, Bimii?

00:03:19.930 --> 00:03:26.100
For some reason, I feel like we are getting a
peek at the dark side of Mikagura Academy...

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:29.440
I wonder if we will be able
to return home alive.

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:34.480
It's hard to return to this form,
after all, ryui...

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:35.820
Return?

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:38.780
Then you used to be human, Bimii?

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:40.530
Yeah, ryui.

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:43.330
It's a long story, ryui.

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:47.370
This isn't how I'm actually
supposed to return to this form...

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:52.880
What?! Please listen to the whole story, ryui!

00:04:01.180 --> 00:04:03.350
Wait, ryui...

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:12.900
Yay! This is finally starting
to look like a clubroom!

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:15.650
Yes. It's just...

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:20.700
It looks a little... no, it looks <i>very</i> dreary...

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:23.740
Don't worry! I've got people to help with that!

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:26.660
Himi and Katai!

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:31.120
Congratulations on forming your new club...!

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:34.000
You said you wanted something to
decorate your new room with, right?

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:37.420
This is a present from the
calligraphy club, a hanging scroll!

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:40.510
Oh, that's nice! A hanging scroll!

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:43.760
Like a newborn butterfly
that's still a caterpillar,

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:47.510
your club will shine
and fly out into the future.

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:49.770
I wrote it with these feelings.

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:53.600
Perverted transformation...?

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:55.110
Metamorphose.

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:56.820
Isn't it great?!

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:58.530
Th-Thanks...

00:04:58.730 --> 00:04:59.730
Well, then.

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:00.780
Minatogawa!

00:05:00.990 --> 00:05:01.900
When did you get here?

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:05.070
I brought a present from
the flower arrangement club.

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:11.080
Oh, flowers bloomed on the scroll!

00:05:14.170 --> 00:05:19.630
Eruna, my present is a double bed
for us to sleep on together, of course.

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:23.630
Huh? Eruna? What's wrong?

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:29.180
The hall... feels like
it's gotten a little colder...

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:31.430
Hey, Ichinomiya!

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:32.480
Congrats!

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:34.520
Everyone's here already, huh?

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:37.230
Eruna, congratulations!

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:40.940
Thanks, Asuhi! What is it? Room fragrance?

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:43.900
Yes, I hope you like it.

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:48.330
You're not going to accept my present...?

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:51.700
Um, Fujishiro?

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:52.620
Huh?

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:53.870
Congratulations!

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:57.460
Y-You have very good manners,
coming to greet Fujishiro, as well.

00:05:57.670 --> 00:06:02.670
You seem promising, so perhaps I will
be a little friendlier with you hereafter.

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:05.510
Ichinomiya, why don't you translate for him?

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:10.680
I'm so happy!
Please be friends with me from now on!

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:12.390
Kiss and heart!

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:14.980
D-Don't change things on your own!

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:16.730
I didn't say the heart part!

00:06:16.940 --> 00:06:19.310
But the kiss was there?

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:21.520
Please be my friend, too!

00:06:26.950 --> 00:06:30.160
Hey. You came, too, Kuzuryu?

00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:31.660
You're not going in?

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:35.500
No, I'm not good with crowds...

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:36.710
Later.

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:49.220
Jeez, I can't believe Enoyan
just put this here and left.

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:51.350
It's very like Kuzuryu, ryui.

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:55.600
I wonder where Seisa is...

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:59.980
Now that you mention it,
she hasn't come by once, ryui.

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:04.070
Maybe Seisa's not happy for me?

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:07.280
May I come in?

00:07:07.490 --> 00:07:11.620
Rumina! Don't tell me you're <i>still</i>
trying to steal this room from us.

00:07:11.830 --> 00:07:13.200
That's not it.

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:15.790
Then did you come to celebrate with us?

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:17.750
Of course that's not it, either.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:23.420
"What is the 'ghost' that lives in the school!?"

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:25.550
Oh, I've heard of it!

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:28.970
I believe people have been
talking about it for a while.

00:07:29.180 --> 00:07:34.220
We, the newspaper club,
have all hands on deck to go after this ghost.

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:36.680
I see. And what do you need from my club?

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:40.770
If you're going to confess,
you should do it now, Ichinomiya.

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:42.480
The true identity of this ghost...

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:44.400
...is you, isn't it?

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:45.440
Huh?

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:48.450
All the news you all made up before!

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:52.490
That fake news you made up
to get club members—

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:57.080
You really made a fool of
the newspaper club, didn't you?

00:07:57.290 --> 00:08:00.370
Oh, thank you for your help, then...

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:03.290
Thanks to you, we happily
welcomed a new member—

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:06.750
I don't see that third guy anywhere, though.

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:12.510
Anyway, you all are the ones
behind this ghost, aren't you?

00:08:12.720 --> 00:08:13.760
That's not true!

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:15.140
We don't know anything about it.

00:08:15.350 --> 00:08:17.930
It's true. I don't remember anything about this.

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:23.690
Hm... Then what in the world
is this ghost's true identity?

00:08:23.900 --> 00:08:25.820
Could it be a real ghost?

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:28.110
R-R-Really?

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:30.280
I-I'm not scared at all!

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:31.450
Me, neither!

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:37.790
I-I'm not sh-shaking at all... rowr...

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:43.080
The newspaper club was thoroughly
embarrassed by all the fake news from before,

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:48.130
so now we must uncover the truth
no matter what and reclaim our name.

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:51.170
Of course, you will help us, too, right?

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:54.010
O-O-Of course I will...

00:08:57.060 --> 00:09:00.640
Eruna, are you really
going to help find the ghost?

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:06.900
Yeah, 'cause ghosts are always
unfortunate, beautiful girls!

00:09:07.110 --> 00:09:09.150
I don't know if it's a beautiful girl or not,

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:15.070
but it's true that I've never really heard
of a ghost filled with happiness...

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:18.910
What?! Then we <i>have</i> to find it,
catch it, and violate it!

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:24.330
It'll help promote the club, too!
And I'm sure Seisa will be surprised!

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:27.040
Seisa, the upperclassman?

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:32.010
Seisa is the reason Eruna created
a new club in the first place, ryui.

00:09:32.220 --> 00:09:38.350
Yeah! My goal right now is to make it
a club that will surprise Seisa!

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:40.430
She's energetic as usual, at least, ryui.

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:42.430
I'm not just energetic!

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:45.440
- I mean, what about you, Bimii?

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:47.190
- Transforming and turning into a handsome student!

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:48.860
- Transforming and turning into a handsome student!
- is for Seisa, isn't it...?

00:09:48.860 --> 00:09:49.400
- Huh?

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:50.820
- Don't "Huh?" me!

00:09:53.950 --> 00:09:56.030
Thanks for waiting!

00:09:56.240 --> 00:09:59.620
Oh? Akama, you and
the drama club are here, too?

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:02.290
We're going to help find the ghost, too!

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:04.660
It seems like it'll be fun.

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:08.920
By the way, it looks like Kumano
had something come up suddenly...

00:10:09.130 --> 00:10:10.670
...so she won't be coming tonight.

00:10:10.880 --> 00:10:14.670
Himi said she has a
stomachache and won't be here.

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:19.300
I see. But I'm glad you're here, Katai!
Here you go!

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:20.220
Huh?

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:22.850
I heard we were going to catch a ghost...

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:26.730
Don't tell me you're planning on
catching a ghost with that equipment...

00:10:26.940 --> 00:10:29.400
Huh? Otone's not here?

00:10:29.610 --> 00:10:33.900
What? But we were supposed
to meet now. Otone's so late...

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:37.070
I think she left before we did, ryui.

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:39.780
Oh? It's from Otone!

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:43.080
What's wrong, ryui?

00:10:43.290 --> 00:10:45.540
Otone said there was something she had to do.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:50.210
Fujishiro is more fainthearted than she looks.

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:53.550
Says the person whose knees are shaking.

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:58.590
N-No! Th-This is just me itching to fight!

00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:01.350
All right, why don't we leave now?

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:02.890
Okay!

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:04.390
Okay...!

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:17.280
You're the first year...

00:11:17.490 --> 00:11:19.070
I'm Otone Fujishiro.

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:21.120
I apologize for calling so late.

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:24.160
I came to speak with Seisa.

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:27.870
Unfortunately, my lady is already in bed...

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:29.330
It's fine.

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:52.310
Little ghost! I won't do anything,
so please come out!

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:54.820
The little ghost isn't here.

00:12:10.420 --> 00:12:11.540
Usamaru, you're too noisy.

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:14.290
Yeah, the ghost'll run away.

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:18.300
B-But, look at that!

00:12:18.510 --> 00:12:19.920
Huh?

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:21.300
Did something happen?

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:22.890
Did you find the little ghost?!

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:25.510
Wh... What!?!

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:27.970
Jeez, there's nothing here.

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:33.560
No... but part of the school looked
like it was collapsing over there.

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:35.610
It doesn't look like it's collapsing to me.

00:12:35.820 --> 00:12:36.770
Yeah.

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:40.240
M-Maybe I just imagined it...

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:46.870
From the data we got
from the newspaper club,

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:52.170
there were the most eyewitness
reports of the ghost around here.

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:57.710
Oh, this is my old nostalgic home!

00:12:57.920 --> 00:13:02.970
Eruna slept in a sleeping bag in this hallway
before she moved to Seisa's mansion.

00:13:03.180 --> 00:13:06.260
Thinking about that time
and how I have a room now...

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:08.640
I've really gotten ahead in life, haven't I?

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:16.810
I remember being really surprised seeing Eruna
hopping around in her sleeping bag around here.

00:13:18.070 --> 00:13:18.900
That's right!

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:21.280
It was too much trouble to get out,
so I'd just move around in my sleeping bag,

00:13:21.490 --> 00:13:23.570
and I'd run into Katai!

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:26.570
At that time, I really thought she was a ghost!

00:13:26.780 --> 00:13:28.870
Hm? Wait a minute...

00:13:29.080 --> 00:13:33.960
There were the most eyewitness reports
of a ghost around here, right...?

00:13:34.170 --> 00:13:37.590
According to the data,
the ghost was just an eerie face

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:40.710
that would appear out of the darkness.

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:42.470
That's what they said.

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:45.180
Could the ghost actually be...

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:49.430
...Ichinomiya, who once wandered
around in her sleeping bag?

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:50.640
Huh?

00:13:52.730 --> 00:13:54.270
Wai... What?

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:56.060
Oh, really?!

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:57.190
Oh, man...

00:13:57.400 --> 00:14:02.400
What? That's kind of a letdown
after we thought we'd found the ghost!

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:04.280
But this is a problem.

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:05.110
Huh?

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:10.490
If Rumina found out the truth
about how the ghost is really you...

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:13.540
Not only did you fake the news from before,

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:17.460
but now you're making fools
of the newspaper club with this?!

00:14:19.090 --> 00:14:20.960
She'd definitely be mad.

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:22.380
Yeah, she would.

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:23.970
Yeah...

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:25.630
Oh, right! Bimii!

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:26.470
Huh?

00:14:26.680 --> 00:14:28.470
I have a favor to ask...

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:43.820
I've found you! You must be the one
behind the uproar about the ghost!

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:45.990
Wait!

00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:56.210
No way... Was it really a ghost...?

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:04.260
I fooled her somehow, ryui...

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:10.850
Ryui...

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:21.770
Oh?

00:15:24.530 --> 00:15:33.160
Please answer, Seisa.
Why won't you go see Eruna?

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:35.490
I wondered what you
could want at such an hour...

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:39.960
Eruna formed a new club for you, Seisa.

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:41.500
You know that, don't you?

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:48.220
Even though Eruna worked hard
to form a club to make you happy,

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:50.720
why won't you be happy for her?

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:53.260
Even though Eruna has been
waiting for you all this time,

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:55.600
why won't you go to her?

00:15:55.810 --> 00:16:01.400
Because your pride won't allow you
to walk over with your own two feet?

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:04.980
Because if she wants to see you,
she should go to you herself?

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:08.690
Because if there's no bread,
she should eat naan?

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:09.900
Are you a celebrity or something?

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:14.030
A magistrate? A shogun? A queen?

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:16.540
Are you teasing her on purpose
and putting on airs?

00:16:16.740 --> 00:16:19.370
Are you having fun leaving her hanging?

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:23.380
Are you a TV personality who disappeared for a
while who's trying to make a comeback by saying,

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.670
"Actually, I'm a sadist despite how I look"

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:28.710
after appearing on TV
for the first time in a while?

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:33.640
Are you an attention seeker who can't
stand it if everyone isn't fawning over you?

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:37.180
Not that it matters to me,
but you didn't really live abroad, did you?

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:38.020
Wha...?

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:39.770
You didn't notice?

00:16:39.980 --> 00:16:43.020
You stopped trying to make your words sound
sophisticated somewhere in the middle.

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:45.770
Th-That has nothing to do
with anything right now, does it?

00:16:45.980 --> 00:16:53.070
And even if I were a sadistic queen,
what does that have to do with you?

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:56.990
Why are you getting angry
about something like that?

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:01.660
That's because...

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:08.750
Anyway, that case is closed!

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:10.460
Wait!

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:16.510
If you were the ghost, Eruna, what was that
thing I saw where the school collapsed?

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:19.140
You probably just weren't looking properly.

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:21.560
No, I really saw it!

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:23.890
Okay, okay. I get it, I get it.

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:28.650
But I didn't know Mr. Bimii could turn human.

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:31.320
Especially using that terrifying method.

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:36.490
That seriously surprised me. What was that
factory-like place supposed to be?

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:39.910
It's probably better not
to talk about that, huh?

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:42.540
But Mr. Bimii sure is taking a long time.

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:44.500
Isn't he just floating around somewhere?

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:46.500
Oh, Enoyan!

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:48.670
Did something happen?

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:51.800
Oh, could it be that after
drinking milk in the night wind,

00:17:52.010 --> 00:17:54.720
you started to long for company
and came to see me?

00:17:54.930 --> 00:17:57.260
That's fine. I'll spend time with you!

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:59.510
That's not it, idiot.

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:01.220
More importantly,

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:04.350
this isn't really something I should have
to come all this way to tell you, but...

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:05.440
Huh?

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:11.860
That purple girl from your club and Seisa
look like they're in a strange situation.

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:13.070
Huh?

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:16.610
Otone and Seisa are?

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:20.700
Your club has nothing to do
with me in the first place.

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:24.960
You don't have to worry about me.
Just do what you want.

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:29.630
Inside Eruna, you are always there.

00:18:29.840 --> 00:18:38.550
No matter how much fun Eruna and I have
together, you are always in her heart, Seisa.

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:45.730
No matter how hard I try, that is a forbidden
place that Fujishiro cannot enter.

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:50.770
You're making a big deal out of nothing.

00:18:50.980 --> 00:18:56.900
But then why? If I were in your place,
I would naturally want to keep my distance.

00:18:57.110 --> 00:18:59.660
You might be right.

00:18:59.870 --> 00:19:05.540
But Fujishiro wants... I want to see
Eruna smiling from her heart!

00:19:07.460 --> 00:19:12.090
Eruna is the first person to understand me.
My first friend.

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:16.380
To me, she is more precious
than anyone else in the world.

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:19.970
The passionate feelings in my heart
are stronger than anyone's.

00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:23.180
Of course, stronger than yours, too, Seisa.

00:19:25.520 --> 00:19:29.480
I will do anything to make you listen to me.

00:19:31.360 --> 00:19:35.570
Do anything? What can you do?

00:19:35.780 --> 00:19:37.860
I won't know unless I try.

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:42.580
If you get too confident just
because you won the rookie battle,

00:19:42.780 --> 00:19:44.540
you'll get hurt.

00:19:50.420 --> 00:19:52.880
Anticomplex!

00:19:53.090 --> 00:19:54.090
Snake!

00:19:59.930 --> 00:20:02.090
Are you planning to fight me with just that?

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:04.600
Sword!

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:27.160
Why is Otone with Seisa...?

00:20:32.670 --> 00:20:34.710
Just now, that was... No way!

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:44.890
Killing Art.

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:56.900
Rain...

00:20:59.280 --> 00:21:01.860
You're not going to use Killing Art?

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:04.910
Are you underestimating me?

00:21:05.120 --> 00:21:06.910
Are you just flowing with confidence?

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:12.120
Are you saying, "It's not worth wasting
my ability on a small fry like you"?

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:13.670
Is that how it is?!

00:21:14.630 --> 00:21:17.380
Or is it so you have an excuse
when you lose to Fujishiro?

00:21:17.590 --> 00:21:21.920
Like, "I didn't use my ability that time.
That's why I lost, tee-hee" or something?

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:23.380
I won't let you get away.

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:35.020
Sword.

00:21:43.280 --> 00:21:46.570
You won't use your ability even now?

00:21:46.780 --> 00:21:50.160
To lose without even using Killing Art?

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:52.960
Please don't let that be your excuse.

00:21:53.460 --> 00:21:54.580
Otone!

00:22:04.260 --> 00:22:05.970
Otone?

00:22:06.180 --> 00:22:07.850
Seisa!

00:23:41.110 --> 00:23:43.770
Hey, hold on!
We aren't far from the last episode,

00:23:43.980 --> 00:23:46.650
so why haven't I shown up yet
in a single preview?! Phooey!

00:23:46.860 --> 00:23:49.570
It's okay, Himi! I was saving this one for you!

00:23:49.780 --> 00:23:51.200
Go ahead and preview all you like!

00:23:51.410 --> 00:23:53.030
Really? Here I go, then!

00:23:53.240 --> 00:23:54.330
Just a moment.

00:23:54.540 --> 00:23:57.160
I haven't been included
in a single preview, either.

00:23:57.370 --> 00:24:01.790
Oh! Putting Miss Kurumi together with Himi!
I never thought of that!

00:24:02.000 --> 00:24:05.210
Both of you, go on and give us
a new preview no one has ever heard!

00:24:05.420 --> 00:24:06.380
Hold on a minute.

00:24:06.590 --> 00:24:10.630
In that case, I haven't done
any previews in my human form.

00:24:10.840 --> 00:24:11.220
Bimii!

00:24:11.430 --> 00:24:14.140
Meh. We don't need you at this point, Mr. Bimii.

00:24:14.350 --> 00:24:15.810
I'll do this preview by myself.

00:24:16.010 --> 00:24:21.600
No, my 287,928 nationwide fans are waiting.

00:24:21.810 --> 00:24:24.480
I wouldn't give this up even for you, Himi.

00:24:24.690 --> 00:24:26.110
Then let's all do it at once.

00:24:26.320 --> 00:24:29.240
We don't need some wimpy preview

00:24:29.450 --> 00:24:31.700
that feels like a bunch of
carefree students holding hands

00:24:31.910 --> 00:24:34.200
and crossing the finish line all at once.

00:24:34.410 --> 00:24:36.290
Next time, "Nostalgic Triangle."

00:24:36.490 --> 00:24:39.580
Aw! You went and said it! No fair, Miss Kurumi!

00:24:39.790 --> 00:24:41.790
They call that stealing a march, mecha!

00:24:42.000 --> 00:24:43.670
You're a disgrace as a teacher, mecha!

00:24:43.880 --> 00:24:46.630
Bimii, calm down!
You're ending your sentences with "mecha"!

00:24:46.840 --> 00:24:50.050
Next time, Lady Seisa's past
will finally be revealed.

00:24:50.260 --> 00:24:55.180
Seisa's past! Now my heart's all pounding!
